 hab has also appeared in TV shows\, such as The Boys\, What We Do In The Sh
 adows\, and Star Trek: Strange New Worlds. He has garnered a loyal followin
 g of over 120k fans on Instagram and 200k on TikTok. Abbas is best known fo
 r his viral “job interview” and “automotive marketing” series\, whi
 ch parody the behind-the-scenes hiring and advertising of major brands. His
